<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss April unemployment rate slips to 5.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Swiss April unemployment rate slips to 5.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Switzerland's unemployment rate stood at 5.5 percent in April, down from March's 5.6 percent, the Federal Office of Trade, Industry and Labour said.</p>
<p>				     April 1997  March 1997  April 1996</p>
<p> Pct of workforce unemployed     5.5	  5.6	    4.5</p>
<p> Number of jobless		 197,732    202,207	164,151</p>
<p> Job vacancies			9,861	8,842	  6,353</p>
</text>
